{"id":"8db0d5d40e579d59","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-3sat-np-complete.md","title":"thm-3sat-np-complete (3SAT is NP-complete)","display":"thm-3sat-np-complete (3SAT is NP-complete)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-3sat]]","[[28-df-sat]]","[[28-df-np-complete]]","[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","[[28-thm-cook-levin]]"],"display":"thm-3sat-np-complete (3SAT is NP-complete)","label":"28-thm-3sat-np-complete","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-3sat-np-complete","3SAT is NP-complete","3SAT NP-completeness"],"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5408daacba221251\" href=\"?note=5408daacba221251\" title=\"28-df-3sat\">28-df-3sat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4041cfa2975b8dd1\" href=\"?note=4041cfa2975b8dd1\" title=\"28-df-sat\">28-df-sat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a9125ebbfdef91e\" href=\"?note=7a9125ebbfdef91e\" title=\"28-df-np-complete\">28-df-np-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14088421136f8182\" href=\"?note=14088421136f8182\" title=\"28-df-poly-reduction\">28-df-poly-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e0fc90210de59068\" href=\"?note=e0fc90210de59068\" title=\"28-thm-cook-levin\">28-thm-cook-levin</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-3sat-np-complete (3SAT is NP-complete)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-3sat-np-complete"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-3sat-np-complete</span><span>3SAT is NP-complete</span><span>3SAT NP-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{SAT}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNFSAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CNFSAT}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{3SAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{3SAT}\\)</span> 使用本目录标准编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{3SAT}\">\\(\\mathrm{3SAT}\\)</span> 的每个子句至多三个文字。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NPComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 见对应定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{3SAT}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\n\\mathrm{SAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{3SAT}\\land\n\\mathrm{CNFSAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{3SAT}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{3SAT}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\n\\mathrm{SAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{3SAT}\\land\n\\mathrm{CNFSAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{3SAT}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R6 证据边界：局部子句拆分与语法树约束已复核；NP 难性仍采用 Cook–Levin 的来源陈述，不把本次局部检查升级为完整机器编码证明。因此本条保留为有来源的定理记录，不作为本次已完整核验的证明依赖。</p>\n<p>一般公式先以每个子公式的值为新变量加入局部门约束，得到等可满足 CNF。长度超过三的子句反复替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\ell_1\\lor\\ell_2\\lor z)\\land(\\neg z\\lor\\ell_3\\lor\\cdots\\lor\\ell_r)\">\\((\\ell_1\\lor\\ell_2\\lor z)\\land(\\neg z\\lor\\ell_3\\lor\\cdots\\lor\\ell_r)\\)</span>，新鲜 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 仅用于该步骤；存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 使新子句同时真当且仅当原子句真。短子句、空子句直接保留。无效输入编码映到固定不可满足 3CNF，归约成为定义于所有二进制串的全函数。猜测有限赋值并检查子句证明 NP 成员资格。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理2.10(2)、引理2.14；印刷45、49页；PDF71、75页。陈述与子句拆分证明已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-3sat","status":"resolved","id":"5408daacba221251","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-3sat]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sat","status":"resolved","id":"4041cfa2975b8dd1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sat]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"7a9125ebbfdef91e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-poly-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"14088421136f8182","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-poly-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-thm-cook-levin","status":"resolved","id":"e0fc90210de59068","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-cook-levin]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{SAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNFSAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{3SAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{3SAT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NPComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{3SAT}\\in\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\land\n\\mathrm{SAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{3SAT}\\land\n\\mathrm{CNFSAT}\\le_m^{\\mathbf P}\\mathrm{3SAT}.","display":true},{"tex":"(\\ell_1\\lor\\ell_2\\lor z)\\land(\\neg z\\lor\\ell_3\\lor\\cdots\\lor\\ell_r)","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false}],"bytes":1771,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"布尔问题：[[28-df-boolean-formula]]、[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]、[[28-df-cnf]]、[[28-df-literal]]、[[28-df-clause]]、[[28-df-sat]]、[[28-df-3sat]]、[[28-thm-cook-levin]]、[[28-thm-3sat-np-complete]]。"